                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEM ZUR ERWÄRMUNG OHNE VERBRENNUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME DE CHAUFFAGE NON COMBUSTIBLE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">A HEAT NOT BURN SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A heat not burn system comprising a device is disclosed. The device comprises a heater apparatus, which includes a heating element. The heating apparatus is configured to removably engage with the device, so as to supply power to the heating apparatus from a power source. The device and the heater apparatus include a locking mechanism, which is configured to unlock when the temperature of the heater apparatus is below the threshold and, when the cooling period is above the threshold, after off state of the heating apparatus.</p>
            </abstract>
